<body><{\f1 \uc0\u9443 }<<Helvetica.ttf><12pts>{\f1 \uc0\u9400 }<#000000> \ql Dear Massimo,\line \line On behalf of Nexus Innovations, I am absolutely thrilled to offer you the position of Senior Product Manager. We were incredibly impressed with your background, your experience, and the perspective you brought to our conversations. We truly believe your skills will make a significant impact on our core product team.\line \line Below are the formal terms of our offer:<table><row><cell>TERM</cell><cell>DETAILS</cell></row><row><cell>Position</cell><cell>Senior Product Manager</cell></row><row><cell>Base Salary</cell><cell>$145,000 per year, paid semi-monthly</cell></row><row><cell>Performance Bonus</cell><cell>Up to 15% annually, based on company and individual milestones</cell></row><row><cell>Equity</cell><cell>5,000 Incentive Stock Options (ISOs), vesting over 4 years</cell></row><row><cell>Start Date</cell><cell>Monday, October 19, 2026</cell></row><row><cell>Location</cell><cell>Remote (with up to 4 trips per year to our San Francisco HQ)</cell></row><row><cell>Benefits</cell><cell>Comprehensive health, vision, and dental; 401(k) with 5% match; unlimited PTO</cell></row></table> \ql To accept this offer, please sign and return this letter by Friday, October 2nd.\line \line We are incredibly excited about the prospect of you joining us. If you have any questions at all, please don't hesitate to reach out directly.\line \line Welcome to the team!\line \line Best regards,\line \line Sarah Jenkins\line Director of Talent Acquisition\line Nexus Innovations>//\line 
